    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_11",
      "hash64": "F2237A00C8F8A7F4",
      "text": "Würdest du mir die Ehre eines kurzen Kampfes\\nerweisen?[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_12",
      "hash64": "F2237D00C8F8AD0D",
      "text": "Ah, du hast noch Vorbereitungen zu treffen?\\nDann werde ich hier warten, bis du bereit bist.[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_13",
      "hash64": "F2237C00C8F8AB5A",
      "text": "Wundervoll! Dann lass uns beginnen.[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_14",
      "hash64": "F2237700C8F8A2DB",
      "text": "Hervorragend. Wirklich ganz ausgezeichnet...[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_15",
      "hash64": "F2237600C8F8A128",
      "text": "Du solltest jedoch wissen, dass die Fertigkeiten\\ndes jungen Herrn Otis die meinen bei Weitem\\r\\nübertreffen. Handle daher mit Vorsicht.[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
